@dc:title "Amplifier vocabulary bundle"
@dc:description "Packages the amplifier vocabulary so disjointness closure fires between sibling concepts."
vocabulary bundle <https://leaphar06.github.io/amplifier-cross-reference-ontology/vocabulary-bundle#> as amplifier-vbundle {
    includes <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <https://leaphar06.github.io/amplifier-cross-reference-ontology/vocabulary#>
}